OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears spread to Asia and
OL,5,AEurope markets
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrillions of dollars have been wiped
OL,8,Foff the stock value of major tech firms
OL,9,Fin the US, Europe and Asia amid
OL,10,Fconcerns of a slowdown in AI
OL,11,Fdevelopment
OL,13,FIt comes after the US midterm
OL,14,Felections, in which a number of
OL,15,FDemocrats campaigned to slow the growth
OL,16,Fof AI data centres - Gina Hinojosa, who
OL,17,Fwon in Texas, pledged to halt new
OL,18,Fcentre construction entirely
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
