OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears spread to Asia and
OL,5,AEurope markets
OL,6,
OL,7,FTudor Brown, a UK tech founder, tells
OL,8,Fthe BBC there were "jitters" around
OL,9,F"infinite AI growth" before the
OL,10,Fmidterms. He adds there's "a lot of
OL,11,Fmoney still being made in these
OL,12,Fcompanies and we'll start to see it
OL,13,Fcoming back a bit"
OL,15,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,16,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,17,Fmore than 5.5% on Thursday; Japan's
OL,18,FNikkei 225 was down 6.3% earlier; the
OL,19,FUK's FTSE 100 index has fallen by 1.6%
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
