OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears spread to Asia and
OL,5,AEurope markets
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome of the larger losses in Asia came
OL,8,Ffrom memory chip makers - Japan, South
OL,9,FKorea and Taiwan make most of the chips
OL,10,Fand equipment for US data centres
